      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `d5acd1a3dcaa23b6d0ac49b503a07acb10ffbf28fd7ac51d692e5742bfcb71d7--prisoners-australia-2015-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 13 of 13\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | ac48d335424414e686aaa6b57d1a2c03248b2c1432dd9d25fbc8f5cf77ec1be5 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | ea767cc712bfe1799d0f80b9b4cfee2e236abc419aa3ab7bedd6cf1bb00f128e | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 917f2237d05747042694532711f39d5fba42e7c5a8142b1c806b66097d76f4f5 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | cf02bec0d0c45518991b299eedf5012d6fef55bb2c111e7973706b330e19ab5e | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 797c685ccc6c1e6bc590d455ef60b46d96f2d93cbfc092da182e653f95d5b98e | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 6032b27b24fa3ecb73a0e5adfe289b2c3832d8b23de140825ec2c84470f1c0e8 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 0e1edb6870734c9c420bd011c006759cbdc7bbf6e72ea629949e052c14d880dc | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 42e83e1b240e617171e2cd6c30193a9f64001684079ad5744e7c3e8573dfc80a | missing |\n| \"Table_8\" | 869ca50071e3ab1eacd3d7ed6618c217e96206bb08d325e8ba19e8608f3aebfe | missing |\n| \"Table_9\" | 1eb5ce2bdf982cfe99c1de17aa322fcbf28e18928587c1f7f734d041347eea57 | missing |\n| \"Table_10\" | f1a7b356fdc73c371dd1a8c1b1b939ff804124e98858afb8189a1f1a87daa7d1 | missing |\n| \"Table_11\" | 1dec1417587b79e1ccdc4e32c7e97dd2f0ceede50c7f80da4846c87e53dd8de6 | missing |\n| \"Table_12\" | 3e7e4d952f9dd2bb3d215fe4fdc1a99722ca6963921c49f2d1cd185fe82004d7 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
